fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gstreamer/gstmessage.html#gst_message_is_writable","fragment":"\n\tgst_message_is_writable\n\n\n\tGst.Message.prototype.is_writable\n\n\n\tGst.Message.is_writable\n\nTests if you can safely modify message. It is only safe to modify message when\nthere is only one owner of the message - ie, the object is writable.\nParameters:\na GstMessage\nTests if you can safely modify message. It is only safe to modify message when\nthere is only one owner of the message - ie, the object is writable.\nParameters:\na Gst.Message\nTests if you can safely modify message. It is only safe to modify message when\nthere is only one owner of the message - ie, the object is writable.\nParameters:\na Gst.Message\n"});